  description: 'Once per turn, you can place 1 counter on this card, then apply the
    appropriate effect depending on the number of counters on this card.

    1:
    Discard 1 Dinosaur monster, then add 1 Dinosaur monster with a different Attribute
    from your Deck to your hand.

    2: Normal Summon 1 WIND or WATER Dinosaur
    monster from your hand.

    3: The names of all WATER Dinosaur monsters you
    currently control become "Hydrogeddon" (until the end of this turn), then add
    1 "Bonding - H2O" from your Deck or GY to your hand.

    4: Remove all counters
    from this card, then change the Attributes/Types of all face-up monsters your
    opponent currently controls to FIRE/Pyro, until the end of this turn.'
